# Copy this file to Packaging/crashbox-dsn.local (gitignored) and paste one
# TandemClip Crashbox public DSN on one line. make-app.sh injects it into the
# bundled Info.plist at package time; the tracked plist keeps CrashboxDSN empty.
# Keep the real file mode 0600. Alternatively, set TANDEMCLIP_CRASHBOX_DSN (or
# TANDEMCLIP_CRASHBOX_CONFIG_FILE) for the build process. The host must be
# ingest.crashbox.dev; make-app.sh refuses any other.

https://PUBLIC_KEY@ingest.crashbox.dev/PROJECT_ID
